    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on our new credit scoring model for a fintech startup. we're trying to align it with our ESG goals and i want to make sure we're being as ethical as possible. can you walk me through why focusing the optimization on 'equality of outcome' is the most ethically sound way for us to handle the algorithm?",
